  "details": "I noticed that clicking some things in the menu plays the click sound louder than intended\n\nThese are the places I noticed this at:\n\n- Clicking world thumbnail in side wing plays the audio louder than usual\n\n- Same for clicking thumbnail from the worlds menu\n\n- Same with clicking the world thumbnail on the Here tab\n\n- Clicking a friend from the side wing and then clicking the thumbnail of a friend\n\n- Clicking instance type when making an instance\n\n- Remove worlds from favorites confirmation (Yes, No)\n\nThere are probably other cases as well.\n\nI noticed this on the current beta, which is build 1662. This might also affect other branches too, like live.",
